RT's performance, as proposed by Howard and Ruder (2018).", "A technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, specifically addressing catastrophic forgetting.", 'A technique used to fine-tune different layers of the model with different learning rates.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 6, 8, 10, 11]}, 'slanted triangular learning rates': {'description': ['A learning rate schedule that starts with a small learning rate, increases it linearly to a maximum value, and then decreases it linearly.', 'A learning rate schedule.', 'A learning rate schedule that increases and then decreases.', 'A learning rate schedule that increases and then decreases.', 'A learning rate schedule that starts with a small learning rate, increases it linearly to a maximum value, and then decreases it linearly.', "A technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, specifically addressing catastrophic forgetting.", 'A learning rate schedule used to optimize model training.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 8, 10, 11]}, 'gradual unfreezing': {'description': ['Fine-tuning the layers of a neural network one by one, starting from the last layer and working backwards.', 'Gradually unfreezing layers of a pre-trained model during fine-tuning.', 'Unfreezing layers of a model one by one during fine-tuning.', 'Unfreezing layers of a model one by one during fine-tuning.', 'Fine-tuning the layers of a neural network one by one, starting from the last layer and working backwards.', "A training technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, as proposed by Howard and Ruder (2018).", "A technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, specifically addressing catastrophic forgetting."], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 6, 8, 10, 11]}, 'GloVe': {'description': ['An unsupervised learning algorithm for obtaining vector representations for words, similar to word2vec, used for capturing semantic relationships between words.', 'Global Vectors for Word Representation (GLoVe) is a pre-training algorithm used for word representation.', 'Global Vectors for Word Representation, a method for obtaining word embeddings.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 4]}, 'Slanted Triangular Learning Rates': {'description': ["A training technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, as proposed by Howard and Ruder (2018).", "A technique used to optimize FinBERT's performance, specifically addressing catastrophic forgetting.", 'A learning rate schedule used to optimize model training.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [10, 6]}, 'Financial PhraseBank dataset': {'description': ['A dataset used for the classification task, specifically for evaluating the performance of FinBERT and other models in sentiment analysis of financial text.', 'The task of classifying sentences from the Financial PhraseBank dataset, used to evaluate the performance of FinBERT and other models.'], 'type': ['task', 'dataset'], 'source_chunk_index': [8]}}
